  "rationale": "The plant automata model the robot's perception (sensor outcomes) and motion capabilities. The specification automata bind sensor outcomes to safe, coverage-oriented actions, enforce recovery after obstacles, and prevent unsafe or oscillatory behaviors. The design ensures forward progress is prioritized in clear states, with conservative but brief recovery actions on obstacle detection. Only one controllable is enabled per action state, and all uncontrollable events are handled deterministically.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for perception (sensor events) and motion (actuators)",
    "Specification automata bind sensor outcomes to safe actions, enforce recovery, and prevent unsafe/oscillatory behaviors"
